# Mikoisbest OS v1 — package list installed by live-build into the ISO chroot.
# Verify every entry against https://packages.debian.org/trixie/<name> before
# each rebuild; do not add anything here that isn't confirmed to exist in
# Debian 13 (trixie) main/contrib/non-free-firmware.
#
# One package per line. Comments start with '#'.

